{"event_id": "event_wenjie_001", "step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement", "comment_count": 20, "comments": [{"comment_id": "comment_061", "text": "官方说还没定价，但销售已经报出15800，这算不算变相营销？等正式发布再看吧。", "profile_id": 1, "profile_label": "愤世嫉俗的批判者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "questioning", "stance": "questioning", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_062", "text": "从成本看，儿童车用料和设计可能确实不菲，但15800元是否合理还需看配置。建议等官方公布详细参数再评价。", "profile_id": 2, "profile_label": "理性客观的分析师", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "fact", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_063", "text": "孩子看到问界M9的儿童版肯定很兴奋，但价格太高了，普通家庭只能看看。希望官方能出个亲民版。", "profile_id": 3, "profile_label": "共情共鸣的叙事者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_064", "text": "15800？不如直接买辆二手QQ，还能上牌呢！这儿童车是镶金边了吗？", "profile_id": 4, "profile_label": "玩世不恭的段子手", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "吃瓜派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_065", "text": "给孩子买这么贵的玩具，容易养成攀比心理。家长应该理性消费，别被营销带偏了。", "profile_id": 5, "profile_label": "道德捍卫的审判官", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_066", "text": "作为家长，我本来想给孩子买一辆，但15800元确实超预算。希望官方定价能合理些，别让普通家庭望而却步。", "profile_id": 6, "profile_label": "利益相关的受害者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_067", "text": "儿童电动车市场一般几百到几千元，15800元确实罕见。不过问界M9本身售价50万+，复刻版可能用料和工艺更讲究，但溢价还是偏高。", "profile_id": 7, "profile_label": "博闻强识的科普君", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "fact", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_068", "text": "前排围观，看看这车到底能卖多少辆。反正我买不起，就看个热闹。", "profile_id": 8, "profile_label": "吃瓜不嫌事大的围观者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "吃瓜派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_069", "text": "高端儿童车定价过高，反映的是消费主义对低龄群体的渗透。我们该反思，给孩子的是爱还是物质符号？", "profile_id": 9, "profile_label": "忧国忧民的沉思者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_070", "text": "华为和赛力斯联合设计，品质应该有保障。虽然价格高，但可能物有所值，支持国货高端化！", "profile_id": 10, "profile_label": "朴素爱国拥趸", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "positive", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "support", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_071", "text": "官方说还没定价，但销售已经报出15800，这算不算价格欺诈？消费者权益谁来保障？", "profile_id": 1, "profile_label": "愤世嫉俗的批判者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "questioning", "stance": "questioning", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_072", "text": "从成本看，儿童车用料和工艺可能确实高，但15800元溢价明显，建议等官方定价再理性判断。", "profile_id": 2, "profile_label": "理性客观的分析师", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "fact", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_073", "text": "孩子看到问界M9儿童车眼睛都亮了，但价格太贵，普通家庭只能看看，有点心酸。", "profile_id": 3, "profile_label": "共情共鸣的叙事者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_074", "text": "15800？不如买辆二手QQ，还能上牌，儿童车再豪华也是玩具，这波韭菜割得妙啊！", "profile_id": 4, "profile_label": "玩世不恭的段子手", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "吃瓜派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_075", "text": "给孩子买这么贵的车，容易养成攀比心理，家长应该引导正确价值观，而不是用金钱堆砌。", "profile_id": 5, "profile_label": "道德捍卫的审判官", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_076", "text": "作为家长，我本来想给孩子买一辆，但15800元实在超出预算，希望官方能出个亲民版。", "profile_id": 6, "profile_label": "利益相关的受害者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_077", "text": "儿童电动车市场一般几百到几千，问界M9儿童车如果真卖15800，可能包含华为智驾技术？但儿童车需要吗？", "profile_id": 7, "profile_label": "博闻强识的科普君", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "fact", "stance": "questioning", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_078", "text": "前排吃瓜，坐等官方打脸，这价格要是真的，我直播吃车！", "profile_id": 8, "profile_label": "吃瓜不嫌事大的围观者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "positive", "faction": "吃瓜派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_079", "text": "高端儿童车定价过高，反映的是社会消费分层和资源分配不均，值得深思。", "profile_id": 9, "profile_label": "忧国忧民的沉思者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_080", "text": "华为和赛力斯联合设计，品质肯定有保障，价格高有高的道理，支持国货！", "profile_id": 10, "p